      "content": "I'm not really sure what you mean by the \"goblin's gaze\" or \"goblin's mask\" in the context of cartography. Can we just focus on the technical side? You mentioned using \"creator unknown\" or custom vocabularies—how would these look in a standard XML/RDF schema implementation?",
